        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Headless Body in Topless Bar\n- People: James Bruce, Peter Koper, Taylor Nichols, Biff Yeager\n- Places: Louisville, Kentucky\n- Topics: American film, acting careers, film credits\n\nFacts:\n- Biff Yeager appeared in the film Black Samurai in 1977.\n- Biff Yeager appeared in the films Repo Man in 1984.\n- Biff Yeager appeared in the films Prime Risk, Girls Just Want to Have Fun, and Savage Dawn in 1985.\n- Biff Yeager appeared in the films Sid and Nancy in 1986, Straight to Hell, Walker, and Banzai Runner in 1987, Edward Scissorhands in 1990, and Another You in 1991.\n- Headless Body in Topless Bar is a 1995 American black comedy and psychological horror film directed by James Bruce and written by Peter Koper.\n- Biff Yeager appeared in Headless Body in Topless Bar in 1995 and in Best Men in 1997.\n- Biff Yeager appeared in White Oleander in 2002 and Paris in 2003.\n- Taylor Nichols was born on March 3, 1959, in Louisville, Kentucky.\n- Taylor Nichols is an American actor best known for roles in the Whit Stillman films Metropolitan, Barcelona, The Last Days of Disco, and Damsels in Distress.",
